Online since 12.11.2026 Share on URL copied in the clipboard! Entry into office: from 1 August 2027 In order to complete our teams dedicated to the advanced rehabilitation and vocational reintegration of accident victims in French-speaking Switzerland, the Romance Rehabilitation Clinic (Suva) in Sion is looking for an Apprenticeship Manager in hospitality and stewardship CFC Our expertise We are specialists in the state-of-the-art rehabilitation and professional reintegration of injured people in French-speaking Switzerland. We also offer specific services for the rehabilitation of bone marrow trauma (para and tetraplegia), amputees and patients who have been burned. Your main missions
• Welcome, advise and respond to guests, clients and patients;
• Prepare rooms for seminars and serve snacks at events;
• Know, prepare and serve simple drinks and dishes;
